OL,3,GNEWSA'I didn't want to move from Seven
OL,4,ASisters - but now I'm delighted'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter 27 years living in the Seven
OL,7,FSisters tower blocks in Rochdale,
OL,8,FAndrew Kowalczyk did not want to leave.
OL,10,FBut he said he felt the demolition of
OL,11,Fthe flats, which have dominated the
OL,12,Ftown's skyline since the 1960s, was
OL,13,F"inevitable" and he was now relieved to
OL,14,Fhave been rehoused.
OL,16,FRochdale Boroughwide Housing (RBH)
OL,17,Fannounced last week that the blocks
OL,18,Fwould be bulldozed and replaced with a
OL,19,Fnew College Bank estate of about 600
OL,20,Fhomes.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
