OL,3,GNEWSA'I didn't want to move from Seven
OL,4,ASisters - but now I'm delighted'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after a 10-year campaign by
OL,7,Fresidents who wanted the flats to be
OL,8,Frefurbished and not knocked down but
OL,9,FRBH said the demolition was the only
OL,10,F"realistic" option.
